'''Lunar New Year''' (お祭りにゃんこ 中国春節編, ''Omatsuri Nyanko Chūgoku Shunsetsu Hen'', '''Festival Cats Chinese New Year''') is an event that first appeared in [[Nyanko Daisensou]] from January 31, 2022 to February 14, 2022 and in other versions from January 16, 2023 to February 20, 2023. Added in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]], it later received updates in Versions [[Version 12.0 Update|12.0]], [[Version 13.1 Update|13.1]], [[Version 14.1 Update|14.1]] and [[Version 15.1 Update|15.1]].

==Event Information==
It's a Lunar New Year's Party with The Battle Cats! Limited events and other cool campaigns are here!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from January 30th (11:00am) until March 9th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Take a chance at the Wildcat Slots and get BIG Cat Food rewards!'''}}<br>
One more chance to get all 7s and earn a jackpot of Cat Food!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from February 13th (11:00am) until March 9th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
Tap the Wildcat Slots tab at the top of the Cat Base menu during this event to see how lucky you'll get! Prizes of at least 777 Cat Food as a special service, only during this event!<br>
Don't miss out!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 4 different special Lunar New Year's Sale Packs to buy!'''}}<br>
Stock up on Cat Food and other awesome items with these spectacular sales!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Sale Period 1: January 30th (11:00am) until February 9th (10:59am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Sale Period 2: February 9th (11:00am) until February 20th (10:59am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Sale Period 3: February 20th (11:00am) until March 9th (10:59am)'''}}<br>
Get tons of Cat Food, Rare Tickets, and more during these limited sale events!<br>
These super deals will only be around for a short time, so don't miss out!

※ Thank-You/Limited Sale Packs can only be purchased once per user account during the sale period.<br>
※ If the Thank-You/Limited Sale Packs fail to appear as scheduled, update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Purchase Cat CPUs to quickly skip battles!'''}}<br>
Cat CPUs and Rare Tickets bundled together in one item pack for purchase!<br>
Use 2 Cat CPUs and Cat Energy to skip previously cleared stages and collect their rewards! Gather up battle rewards quickly with the items in this pack!<br>
※ The Cat CPU Pack can only be purchased once during the sale period.<br>
※ Skip battle functionality is unlocked after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 1 Hawaii.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited Sale: Get Special Units for 50% off their usual Cat Food cost!'''}}<br>
Purchase Special units for half-off the normal Cat Food cost during the event to get through a tough stage!<br>
Get the Special Cats you want most for cheap!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited "Lunar New Year's Event Capsules"!'''}}<br>
※ The Event Capsules can only be used with Event Tickets earned in-game.<br>
※ Event Capsules will be unavailable after the event ends and Event Tickets will be unusable.<br>
※ Extra Event Tickets cannot be converted into items or XP.<br>
※Once all stage attempts have been used, you will be able to retry after a certain amount of time has passed.<br>
※ Using a Catamin A will immediately grant you another stage attempt.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Lunar New Year's Login Stamp Campaign!'''}}<br>
Log in each day during the event to earn rewards!<br>
{{Color|#0000FF|'''Reward(s): Cat Food, Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, Battle Items, etc.'''}}<br>
※There are 21 stamps available during this event.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Fight back against dark forces in "Cover of Darkness"!'''}}<br>
It's a seasonal period piece! A flood of Dark enemies attacks your cats in this special Cover of Darkness map!
Reward(s): {{Color|#0000FF|'''Rare Ticket'''}}, {{Color|#0000FF|'''Cat Ticket'''}}, {{Color|#0000FF|'''XP'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''On from February 13th (11:00am) until March 9th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
※Check the Timed Score rewards button at the bottom right of the map screen for available stage rewards.<br>
※ This stage will appear after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 1.<br>
※ You must clear Empire of Cats Ch. 3 in order to play this stage.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Challenge the limited-time map "A Colossal New Year!"'''}}<br>
A fresh new year enters with a bang! Expect no mercy from these extra-tough gauntlet stages, filled with enemies befitting this Lunar Year!<br>
Reward(s): {{Color|#0000FF|'''Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, etc.'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''On from February 13th (11:00am) until March 9th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Tons of Gifts from the map "New Year's Bling!"'''}}<br>
After an endless wait... your Lunar New Year's gifts have arrived!<br>
Get a mystery Lunar New Year's reward on stage clear - open it up and check the contents for yourself!<br>
Reward(s): {{Color|#0000FF|'''XP'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''On from February 13th (11:00am) until March 9th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Doges of various Traits appear in the special stage "Snow Doges"!'''}}<br>
Play in the snow with a group of Doges! This limited-time stage features Doges with a wide variety of Traits!<br>
Reward(s): {{Color|#0000FF|'''Catseye (Super Rare, Uber Rare, Legend)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''On from February 13th (11:00am) until March 9th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
※"Snow Doges" is accessible after reaching User Rank 1600 or above.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Monthly Event All-Stars Grateful Gathering'''}}<br>
A super challenge featuring the familiar faces of enemies from Monthly Event stages, gathered together for one tough map! Get a chance to earn up to {{Color|#FF0000|'''30,000,000 XP'''}} by clearing the stage!

Topple these seasonal baddies and earn mountains of XP to power up your Cat Army!

※ After clearing a stage in a Gauntlet map, there will be a cooldown period before you are able to challenge the next stage in the series.<br>
※ Spending a Catamin A during this cooldown period will allow you to immediately challenge the next.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Face down the storms of Cyclonefest!'''}}<br>
Put on your raincoat, board up your windows and get ready for Cyclonefest!<br>
